Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:10.117 --> 00:00:14.265
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.315 --> 00:00:18.224
Today we learn: Transportation. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.618
Commute. Say it with me. Commute!

6
00:00:26.124 --> 00:00:30.424
Rush hour. Say it with me. Rush hour!

7
00:00:33.902 --> 00:00:36.852
Fare. Say it with me. Fare!

8
00:00:40.431 --> 00:00:43.347
Route. Say it with me. Route!

9
00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.680
Punctuality. Say it with me. Punctuality!

10
00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:57.512
Carpool. Say it with me. Carpool!

11
00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.711
Pedestrian. Say it with me. Pedestrian!

12
00:01:08.178 --> 00:01:12.111
Traffic jam. Say it with me. Traffic jam!

13
00:01:15.645 --> 00:01:18.779
Delay. Say it with me. Delay!

14
00:01:22.252 --> 00:01:25.552
Vehicle. Say it with me. Vehicle!

15
00:01:29.028 --> 00:01:32.811
Sustainable. Say it with me. Sustainable!

16
00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:40.375
Eco-friendly. Say it with me. Eco-friendly!

17
00:01:43.911 --> 00:01:54.126
Grammar time! Reasons with because. Listen. I carpool because it is eco-friendly and saves money.

18
00:01:54.176 --> 00:02:00.654
Your turn. Say it with me. I carpool because it is eco-friendly and saves money.

19
00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:13.470
During rush hour, the traffic jam causes long delays. I try to carpool or use eco-friendly transport when I can.

20
00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.061
I like this story!

21
00:02:16.021 --> 00:02:21.236
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:21.286 --> 00:02:22.393
Fare!

23
00:02:23.128 --> 00:02:28.348
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:29.548
Pedestrian!

25
00:02:30.636 --> 00:02:38.758
Think and answer. How do you usually get to school, and why?

26
00:02:38.808 --> 00:02:39.958
Great answer!

27
00:02:41.048 --> 00:02:45.009
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
